 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nRandstad Componenten BV                                   MASTER SERVICES\nKeizersgracht 12, 3011 AA Rotterdam, Netherlands                    AGREEMENT\nBTW-nummer: NL234870359B01\nReg No: NL-589907\n\nFROM                                                     FACTUURADRES\n\nRandstad Componenten BV                                  Randstad Componenten BV\nKeizersgracht 12                                         Keizersgracht 12\n3011 AA Rotterdam                                        3011 AA Rotterdam\nNetherlands                                              Netherlands\nVAT: NL234870359B01\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 24-04-2026 (the \"Effective\nDate\") by and between Randstad Componenten BV, with its registered office at Keizersgracht 12,\nRotterdam (\"Party A\"), and Randstad Componenten BV, with its registered office at Keizersgracht 12,\nRotterdam (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 24 months from the Effective Date unless\nterminated earlier in accordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall\nuse it solely for the purposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of the State of New York.\n\nSignatures\n Party A   Randstad Componenten BV / Emma Bakker\n Party B   Randstad Componenten BV / Jan de Vries\n Date      24-04-2026",
